                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1f1d9dc0-53f9-3cde-8c5f-4da015df2c2d",
                        "entry_id": "90d3c2da-caa4-34a5-b1d8-1a7681fa0f94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to throw down"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "poetic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6087cac0-2f94-4111-932b-0ec2df0f4d78",
                                "sense_id": "1f1d9dc0-53f9-3cde-8c5f-4da015df2c2d",
                                "text": "Во весь дух несу́тся ту́чи. Их пока́ ма́ло — отде́льные зу́бчатые обло́мки. И так: бу́дто наверху́ уже́ низри́нут како́й-то го́род, и летя́т вниз куски́ стен и ба́шен, расту́т на глаза́х с ужаса́ющей быстрото́й — всё бли́же, — но ещё дни им лете́ть сквозь голубу́ю бесконе́чность, пока́ не ру́хнут на дно, к нам, вниз.",
                                "translation": "The clouds are rushing with terrific speed. There are few of them as yet, separate fragments; it is as if above us an unknown city were being destroyed and pieces of walls and towers were rushing down, coming nearer and nearer with tremendous speed, but it will take some days of rushing through the blue infinite before they reach the bottom, that is us, below.",
                                "english": "The clouds are rushing with terrific speed. There are few of them as yet, separate fragments; it is as if above us an unknown city were being destroyed and pieces of walls and towers were rushing down, coming nearer and nearer with tremendous speed, but it will take some days of rushing through the blue infinite before they reach the bottom, that is us, below."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4ab42abb-b028-3d78-b60f-e3342a8ef2aa",
                        "entry_id": "90d3c2da-caa4-34a5-b1d8-1a7681fa0f94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to overthrow, to throw down, to dethrone"
                        ],
